abstract: >-
  OpenVolley is a lightweight, self-hosted volleyball competition platform built
  on Bun, Hono, React 19, Three.js, and SQLite WAL. It integrates a real-time
  rally scoring engine with adaptive Server-Sent Events and ETag fallback,
  symmetric single-elimination tournament brackets with third-place routing, a
  PIN-gated Arena TV venue scoreboard, role-based tournament administration, and
  an in-browser broadcast Media Studio for multi-ratio posters and animated
  match highlight videos.
